                  "title": "Title",
                  "body": "# Customer Support & Lifecycle Services — Production Recovery"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Text",
                  "body": "## Proposal Metadata\n- Number: OFF-2026-S134\n- Customer: CASCADES PISCATAWAY\n- Plant: Piscataway Plant\n- Country: USA\n- Language: es\n- Currency: EUR\n- Duration: 12 months\n- Validity Days: 45\n- Payment Terms: 50% upon order, 50% upon first visit"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Text",
                  "body": "## Executive Summary\nExecutive summary updated by AHDE mission action."
                },
                {
                  "title": "Text",
                  "body": "## Services\n### Preventive Maintenance Programme\n4 preventive visits/year with full mechanical and electrical scope.\n- Service ID: preventive_maintenance\n- Frequency: 4 visits/year\n- Quantity: 1.0\n- Unit Price: 35000.00 EUR\n- Total: 35000.00 EUR\n- Optional: No\n- Coverage: Mechanical + Electrical + Automation\n- Deliverables: Visit report, corrective action list, annual roadmap"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Text",
                  "body": "### IngPRO Digital Monitoring\nContinuous monitoring with anomaly detection.\n- Service ID: ingpro\n- Frequency: Continuous\n- Quantity: 1.0\n- Unit Price: 15000.00 EUR\n- Total: 15000.00 EUR\n- Optional: Yes\n- Coverage: Critical assets"
